node 8 Compositing Comment
  id c_picture
  pos 0 0
  s text PICTURE: a Field Pixel scene draws the lily and three atom orbits from time; the chain to its right adds glow, trails and a rainbow lens fringe. Read left to right.
  f width 900
  f height 110
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  id c_scene
  pos 0 146
  s text Scene: edit the 'code' text to change the flower. Petals breathe on a 12 s cycle, the same period as the breath LFO below.
  f width 440
  f height 150
end
node 10 Compositing Comment
  id c_glow
  pos 600 146
  s text Bloom: flashes on every arp note (onset) and swells with loudness.
  f width 440
  f height 150
end
node 11 Compositing Comment
  id c_ghost
  pos 1200 146
  s text Trails: the low band lengthens the afterimage.
  f width 440
  f height 150
end
node 12 Compositing Comment
  id c_lens
  pos 1800 146
  s text Lens: chroma is the rainbow fringe (breath LFO); barrel kicks on each onset.
  f width 440
  f height 150
end
node 13 Compositing Comment
  id c_out
  pos 3280 146
  s text Output: picture in, final mix in the audio slot.
  f width 340
  f height 110
end
node 14 Compositing Comment
  id c_sound
  pos 0 972
  s text SOUND: a slow pad plus a minimal arp. Pad > chorus, arp > delay, both into the mixer > reverb > limiter > Output.
  f width 900
  f height 110
end
node 15 Compositing Comment
  id c_pad
  pos 480 1734
