  f width 520
  f height 130
end
node 16 Compositing Comment
  id c_arp
  pos 480 1118
  s text Arp: up/down over 2 octaves with a short gate. Feeds the pluck; its notes create the onset that flashes the picture.
  f width 440
  f height 150
end
node 17 Compositing Comment
  id c_hall
  pos 4320 1118
